'''Voltorb''' (Japanese: '''ビリリダマ''' ''Biriridama'') is a {{ct|Lightning}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Space-Time Smackdown}} expansion.

