==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|EX Legend Maker|Voltorb|68}} from the {{TCG|EX Legend Maker}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare print features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Voltorb}}.
*'''Big Explosion''' shares its Japanese name with '''Boomer''', a [[Special Trait]] in the [[Pokémon Rumble series]].
**As an attack in the TCG, it first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Dragon|Graveler|29}} from the {{TCG|EX Dragon}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

